  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:15.420" end="00:18.730" ttm:agent="v1">Lord knows and I think I know it too sometimes</p>
      <p begin="00:18.730" end="00:22.070" ttm:agent="v1">Everything and yhey reachin' out for what's mine</p>
      <p begin="00:22.070" end="00:25.560" ttm:agent="v1">Lord knows and I think I know it too sometimes</p>
      <p begin="00:25.560" end="00:28.540" ttm:agent="v1">Everything and yhey reachin' out for what's mine</p>
      <p begin="00:28.540" end="00:32.060" ttm:agent="v1">I've been awake for days, so we out living life in the night</p>
      <p begin="00:32.060" end="00:34.710" ttm:agent="v1">Pray to God, man I hope I don't die</p>
      <p begin="00:34.710" end="00:38.860" ttm:agent="v1">I've been awake for days, so we out living life in the night</p>
      <p begin="00:38.860" end="00:42.080" ttm:agent="v1">Pray to God, man I hope I don't die</p>
      <p begin="00:42.080" end="00:45.760" ttm:agent="v1">Lord knows and I think I know it too sometimes</p>
      <p begin="00:45.760" end="00:49.150" ttm:agent="v1">Everything and yhey reachin' out for what's mine</p>
      <p begin="00:49.150" end="00:52.530" ttm:agent="v1">Lord knows and I think I know it too sometimes</p>
      <p begin="00:52.530" end="00:55.640" ttm:agent="v1">Everything and yhey reachin' out for what's mine</p>
      <p begin="00:55.640" end="00:59.000" ttm:agent="v1">Two, two, two bedrooms, seven little childs, can't be right</p>
      <p begin="00:59.000" end="01:02.280" ttm:agent="v1">Call my brother, he in prison doin time, but we alright</p>
      <p begin="01:02.280" end="01:05.240" ttm:agent="v1">Tried my best just to catch a fucking smile</p>
      <p begin="01:05.240" end="01:08.600" ttm:agent="v1">But for now I see myself ain't hitting the thirtyfive</p>
      <p begin="01:08.600" end="01:12.430" ttm:agent="v1">I've been awake for days, so we out living life in the night</p>
      <p begin="01:12.430" end="01:15.180" ttm:agent="v1">Pray to God, man I hope I don't die</p>
      <p begin="01:15.180" end="01:19.210" ttm:agent="v1">I've been awake for days, so we out living life in the night</p>
      <p begin="01:19.210" end="01:22.360" ttm:agent="v1">Pray to God, man I hope I don't die</p>
      <p begin="01:22.360" end="01:26.150" ttm:agent="v1">Lord knows and I think I know it too sometimes</p>
      <p begin="01:26.150" end="01:29.460" ttm:agent="v1">Everything and yhey reachin' out for what's mine</p>
      <p begin="01:29.460" end="01:32.720" ttm:agent="v1">Lord knows and I think I know it too sometimes</p>
      <p begin="01:32.720" end="01:34.500" ttm:agent="v1">Everything and yhey reachin' out for what's mine</p>
